  "description": "<p>Celebrate love and inclusivity with this vibrant Pride Rainbow Doormat. Featuring colorful rainbow-inspired artwork, this doormat adds a cheerful aesthetic to your home. It creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, perfect for greeting guests and enhancing your decor.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with inclusive artwork.</li>\n<li>Adds personality and warmth with a vivid, long-lasting print.</li>\n<li>Designed for everyday use with a comfortable surface.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Perfect for creating an inclusive home aesthetic in various decor styles.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Other Special Features</td>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This decorative doormat is ideal for front doors, entryways, patios, and porches. It also works well in apartments, dorms, classrooms, and offices, offering a welcoming touch to any indoor or outdoor area.</p>",
